# =============================================================================
# main-branch .gitignore
#
# main carries the production surface only: solver, designs, docs, workflows,
# scripts, tests. Development material lives on the dev branch.
#
# Several rules below are allowlists (ignore a directory, then re-include the
# specific paths main keeps). They exist because `git add -A` from a working
# tree that also has dev content would otherwise silently re-commit ~270 files
# that were deliberately removed. Ignoring never affects already-tracked files,
# so checking out dev still works normally.
# =============================================================================

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
# Branch-private Claude/GitHub/reference material
/CLAUDE.md
/.github/
/references/

# --- Test scratch ------------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.pytest_tmp*/
pytest-of-*/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
references/**/__pycache__/

# --- Generated run artifacts -------------------------------------------------
# Solver output. Never commit these: an old output directory is not a design,
# and treating one as such is how several campaigns ended up on a stale circuit.
outputs/
# Keep generated map/transient outputs ignored even if broader rules change.
/outputs/
/outputs/**
.hybrid_outputs/
/.pytest*/
/pytest-of-*/
diagnostics/
plots/
logs/
industrial_completion_outputs/

# --- Scratch and temp run directories ----------------------------------------
tmp*/
tmp_*
*.tmp

# --- Stray root-level data ---------------------------------------------------
# Data belongs in docs/ or an output directory, never loose at the root.
/*.csv
/*.npz
/*.npy
/*.jl

# --- Editor backups and pre-edit snapshots -----------------------------------
*.before_*
*.orig
*.rej
*~
* copy.*
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- LaTeX build artifacts ---------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.toc
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
# Scoped to docs/ so it catches LaTeX build logs without shadowing the tracked
# run logs kept as reference artifacts under references/.
docs/**/*.log

# --- experiments/ : allowlist ------------------------------------------------
# main keeps only the modules the production drivers and tests actually import.
# Everything else in this directory is history and lives on dev.
experiments/*
!experiments/pump_solvers/
!experiments/TWPA_THEORY.pdf
!experiments/exp07_python_ipm_design_builder.py
!experiments/exp08_full_ipm_pump_solve.py
!experiments/exp09_full_ipm_gain_from_pump.py
!experiments/exp10_full_ipm_pump_map_warmstart.py
!experiments/exp10_jc_doc_python_design_builders.py
!experiments/exp20_multitone_compression.py
!experiments/exp22_spatial_attribution.py
!experiments/pump_basis.py
!experiments/ripple_common.py

# --- designs/ : keep the production design only ------------------------------
/designs/*
!/designs/ipm_2c_fixed/
!/designs/ipm_2c_fixed/**

# --- docs/development/ : development material -------------------------------
/docs/development/

